# Local-first privacy

## Default

- All tasks, schedules, completion history, and settings live **on device**
- No account gate for core features
- No analytics, crash reporters, or ad SDKs unless `docs/` explicitly accepts them

## Permissions

- Request only what reminders and (optional) exact alarms need
- Do not add `INTERNET` except for the documented opt-in Google Drive App Data path (`docs/01-architecture.md`, `docs/07-google-sync.md`)
- Prefer storage Access that matches sideload/backup story (user-initiated export/import files)

## Data

- Schema should support export/import (JSON or similar) early so tablet↔phone moves are possible without cloud
- Never log task titles to third parties
